        "custom_html": "<ul class=\"custom-icon-text\"><li><b>Breast Size Difference:</b> Determine the difference<br>\nbetween your breast sizes.</li>\n<li><b>Desired Level of Shaping:</b> Consider whether you need<br>\nlight, medium, or extra shaping.</li>\n<li><b>Activity Level:</b> Choose inserts suitable for your lifestyle,<br>\nwhether it's everyday wear, workouts, or special occasions</li></ul>",
